@startuml ACT_05_Execute_Test_Suite
!theme plain
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #333333
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #666666
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title ACT-05: Execute Test Suite Activity

|QA Engineer|
start
:Select project;
:Scan available test suites;
:Select test suite from tree;
:Configure browser and profile;
:Click Start Execution;

|System|
:Validate execution configuration;
:Create execution run record (status: running);
:Notify user of execution start;

|Mocha + Playwright|
:Ensure Playwright browser installed;
:Spawn Mocha process via Node.js;
:Run test suite;

|System|
fork
  :Stream execution logs to screen;
fork again
  |QA Engineer|
  :Monitor live log output;
end fork

|Mocha + Playwright|
:Complete test execution;
:Return exit code;

|System|
:Locate execution report;

if (Mochawesome JSON report found?) then (yes)
  :Parse test case results from JSON;
else (no)
  :Extract aggregate counts from output;
endif

:Save execution results to data store;
:Update run record (status, stats);
:Notify user of completion;

|QA Engineer|
:View execution summary;
:Review test case results;
:Check logs and stack traces if needed;
stop

@enduml
